  "notes": "{混|ま}ざる is a godan verb meaning to be mixed or blended.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{混|ま}ぜる→混ぜる：02423_mazeru⟧ (transitive - to mix)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- AがBに{混|ま}ざる: A mixes into B\n- AとBが{混|ま}ざる: A and B mix together\n- ⟦{色|いろ}→色：00849_iro⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{混|ま}ざる: colors blend\n- ⟦{砂糖|さとう}→砂糖：00884_satou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{混|ま}ざる: sugar dissolves into water\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{混|ま}ざる: to mingle with people\n\nALTERNATE KANJI:\n- {混|ま}ざる: to be mixed (substances)\n- ⟦{交|ま}ざる→交ざる：28479_mazaru⟧: to mingle (people, used interchangeably)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{混|ま}じる→混じる：02421_majiru⟧: to be mixed (slightly more literary)\n- ⟦{混|こ}む→混む：02574_komu⟧: to be crowded (different reading)",
